---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import damonPlaying from '../assets/about/damon-playing.jpg';
---
<Base
  title="About — The Session Notes"
  current="about"
  description="The Session Notes is an interview publication by Damon Uyehara about the working music world — the players, teachers, engineers, and industry people doing the daily work of a music career."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="about">
      <div class="kicker">About the project</div>
      <h1>Most music writing talks to the famous. This talks to everyone else.</h1>
      <p>The Session Notes is a series of interviews with the people who make music work: the players, teachers, engineers, bookers, managers, and label people doing the day-to-day work of a music career. Each conversation gets into how they got started, how they make a living, and what building a life in music actually takes.</p>
      <p>New interviews come regularly, and the goal is simple: to build an honest record of the working music world, one conversation at a time.</p>

      <figure class="about-photo">
        <Image src={damonPlaying} alt="Damon Uyehara playing snare drum" widths={[600, 1000, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 720px" />
      </figure>

      <div class="kicker">About the writer</div>
      <p>The Session Notes is written by Damon Uyehara, a senior at Fremont High School in Sunnyvale, California.</p>
      <p>Damon came up through high school band and drumline. In 2026 he marched snare with Blue Devils C, playing in stadiums like the Rose Bowl and Stanford Stadium. Being around that world made him curious about how working musicians and artists actually grow, what their process looks like, and how the business side really works.</p>
      <p>This project is his way of finding out, by talking to the people already inside the industry. Damon wants to build a career in music, supporting artists and helping the scene grow, and these conversations are where that starts.</p>

      <a class="back" href="/contact">Get in touch →</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
